  Pseudocode:

  ```
  if (x < y) return 17;
  else return 23;
  ```

  Expressions:

  ```python
  f1 = lambda: tf.constant(17)
  f2 = lambda: tf.constant(23)
  r = tf.case([(tf.less(x, y), f1)], default=f2)
  ```

